    {
      "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneI_3.4/p@33642",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MESSENGER.\nThy biddings have been done, and every hour,\nMost noble Caesar, shalt thou have report\nHow ’tis abroad. Pompey is strong at sea,\nAnd it appears he is beloved of those\nThat only have feared Caesar. To the ports\nThe discontents repair, and men’s reports\nGive him much wronged.",
