    {
      "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneI_3.4/p@34488",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SECOND MESSENGER.\nCaesar, I bring thee word\nMenecrates and Menas, famous pirates,\nMake the sea serve them, which they ear and wound\nWith keels of every kind. Many hot inroads\nThey make in Italy—the borders maritime\nLack blood to think on’t—and flush youth revolt.\nNo vessel can peep forth but ’tis as soon\nTaken as seen; for Pompey’s name strikes more\nThan could his war resisted.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
