      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CAESAR.\nLet his shames quickly\nDrive him to Rome. ’Tis time we twain\nDid show ourselves i’ th’ field, and to that end\nAssemble we immediate council. Pompey\nThrives in our idleness.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
