      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LEPIDUS.\nFarewell, my lord. What you shall know meantime\nOf stirs abroad, I shall beseech you, sir,\nTo let me be partaker.",
